                    \\\
                    A &amp;\stackrel{u}{\to} &amp; C
                    }
                    \\,.
          .num_remark
            %h6#remark Remark
            %p
              This essentially says that
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi A
                    %msub
                      %mo ×
                      %mi C
                    %msup
                      %mi C
                      %mi I
                    %msub
                      %mo ×
                      %mi C
                    %mi B
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} A \times_C C^I \times_C B
              is the universal object that makes the diagram
